[SetUp "1"]
[UTCDate "2020.11.17"]
[UTCTime "19:10:37"]

{ There are some occasions when having a bad Bishop is a good thing. No matter how crazy it sounds, it has to do with the protection of pawns. In particular, a bad Bishop in cooperation with his pawns creates a protective wall that creates problems for your opponent. A pawn protected by another pawn or Bishop is more difficult to be captured. }
1. Be3 { this bad Bishop can protect his own pawns from the opponent’s pieces and especially by the black Knight.
However, the result brought by a good Bishop shall be better for sure, compared with the result brought by a bad Bishop, who protects only his own pawns. } *


